17:'Run the complete corrected ten-execution iteration through the declared Stage 17 operation only. Use the application-assigned corrected iteration/candidate and reserved run/context identities. Freeze the corrected candidate, execute exactly ten new independent contexts with prior outputs withheld, verify the complete applicable matrix, compare all runs, root-cause every new material defect, execute required regressions, and perform only evidence-supported corrections through their declared suboperations. Completion flags/counts are application-derived; do not shortcut the cycle.',
18:'Evaluate convergence only from the latest completed current iteration. Explain remaining defects, blockers, mandatory unknowns, contradictions, ambiguities, missing evidence, or unexplained correctness-affecting variance. Do not set application-owned metrics. Convergence requires complete mandatory specification/verification coverage, all applicable regressions successful, and simultaneous zero counts for critical/major defects, mandatory unresolved unknowns, correctness-affecting contradictions/ambiguities, and unexplained correctness-affecting execution variance. If not converged, identify the earliest return stage supported by evidence.',
