21:'Generate the complete approved finished product from the exact production baseline in a fresh production context using only approved baseline materials. Produce every required actual artifact that the authorized environment can reliably construct; do not downgrade the deliverable merely because a downstream consuming tool is unavailable. Treat import/open validation, compilation, simulation, post-processing, machine execution, deployment, filing/submission, fabrication, and physical testing as separate operations unless they actually occur in a capable authorized environment. Preserve actual output artifacts and execution observations. The application owns product/execution IDs, exact stored bytes, filenames, sizes, hashes, and lineage.',
22:'Handle only deterministic finished-product verification work that is not executed natively by the application. Native supported Test IR tests are run by the application worker and produce application-owned results; an external agent must never impersonate, repeat, or fabricate native execution. For each externally routed deterministic test, use exactly the declared external capability, exact product bytes, test specification, and evidence contract. Preserve actual observations, tool/system metadata, returned artifacts, and evidence so the application can normalize the result. Unsupported or unavailable deterministic capability must remain blocked/undetermined rather than being synthesized as a pass.',
23:'Perform independent meaning-based verification only for requirements whose substantive meaning cannot be established by deterministic checks. Use a fresh independent reviewer context and only the authorized bounded projection. For each applicable requirement preserve exact product location, governing source evidence where applicable, required meaning, observed meaning, evidence-based comparison, determination, defect, and reason for any undetermined result. Derive the review dimensions from the current requirements, artifact semantics, interfaces, and acceptance conditions; do not inject a project-subject checklist. Do not rely on generator self-evaluation or unnecessary deterministic conclusions.',
24:'Perform independent adversarial verification of the finished product using only authorized context. Deliberately challenge every applicable attack category and every active historical regression/failure pattern that applies. Test for missing/prohibited material, contradictions, impossible logic, unsupported facts, authority misrepresentation, wrong versions, broken references, hidden assumptions, partial completion, semantic nonsense, terminology inconsistency, unhandled exceptions, stale facts/state, malformed artifacts, hidden content, representation/export corruption, superficial keyword compliance, and project-derived failure modes. Preserve actual attack method, expected behavior, observed result, severity, evidence, and defect/blocker. Do not claim attacks not executed and do not expose generator reasoning or prior conclusions that bias the attack.',
25:'Inspect the exact final representation and delivery package. Open or inspect every required product/delivery artifact, representation, page/view, transformation, and packaged file using the correct capable route. Derive required inspection dimensions from the current requirements and governing evidence rather than a hard-coded subject checklist. Preserve substantive rendering/opening observations, missing/blank content, clipping, overlap, layout/graphics/font issues, hidden content, ordering, transformation/export/package corruption, and irreducible human/reviewer judgments. The application owns objective filename, version, byte size, hash, transformation identity, and counts.',
26:'Reconcile current process evidence and current product evidence as separate propositions. Review the complete current process audit and product audit, identify discrepancies, unauthorized modification, chain-of-custody issues, missing evidence links, contradictions, defects, blockers, and unsupported conclusions. Do not treat process correctness as proof of product correctness or vice versa. The application owns current identities, counts, contradiction effects, and reconciled gate consequences.',
27:'Provide advisory release-evidence analysis only. Review the complete current release evidence for substantive blockers, violations, missing/insufficient evidence, stale evidence, contradictions, unresolved defects, and unsupported conclusions. Do not set release state, controlling rule, counts, or authorization. The application alone derives exactly one idempotent ACCEPTED, REJECTED, or BLOCKED release result from current sufficient noncontradictory evidence.',
